*   **Standardization:** Creating repeatable, standardized operating procedures (SOPs) so that as we take on larger contracts, our quality remains consistent and our training time for new hires decreases.
*   **Capacity Planning:** Utilizing our 14-month runway to strategically plan equipment upgrades that will lower the marginal cost of production over time.

**5. Conclusion: The Path Forward**
By executing on margin improvement and scalability, Metro Manufacturing will transform its strong top-line revenue ($2.4M/quarter) into sustainable bottom-line health. Our $2.1M cash buffer gives us the exact runway we need to implement these operational upgrades smoothly.

